{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）上午10時09分，旺角太子道西近洗衣街有3車相撞，包括寶馬私家車、密斗貨車及巴士。救援人員到場協助，其中私家車中年女乘客頭部受傷，清醒由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，太子道西（往大角咀方向）近洗衣街的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"私家車女乘客受傷。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172135722946138112893705.jpeg/49d4-KnS4c5LY5dG1ISXWDNT9LSLG2ke4XdX_MR3V_w\"/><figcaption>私家車女乘客受傷。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車車頭凹陷損毀。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172135725706121216508369.jpeg/PTmSEwgXeTEZs_TvIFbxKl0phGzU8m0lxI_FmOGPxZg\"/><figcaption>貨車車頭凹陷損毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車車尾被撞至凹陷。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172140859672498176693781.jpeg/EVRQBVLFZbtXZL_iy3yr-x32Bq7YF-kVox_CYIkfwmA\"/><figcaption>私家車車尾被撞至凹陷。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車安全氣袋彈出。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172140865565757440856417.jpeg/9fNI2Xh3AnQ3wmhmQJel0etSjHa0HJqYP07yhRVO8oU\"/><figcaption>私家車安全氣袋彈出。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地面遺下私家車碎片。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172140862658973696958076.jpeg/E6JmF8PExydmqQMWQisL9WQBVsK3rzXAs78RVJm_EVQ\"/><figcaption>地面遺下私家車碎片。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172140868430598144258963.jpeg/tsDBRkOu12rsPB6pF3ZLvPBmQ2RbN33PEbzrjTu8640\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T03:43:58.799960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}